HARTING stands for strong connections – across the globe. As one of the leading international suppliers of industrial connectivity, we are connecting customers to their digital future. And as an employer? We connect around 6,000 people at our headquarter in Espelkamp and at locations worldwide. Here you’ll find great colleagues, as well as ever new opportunities and innovations revolving around IoT and artificial intelligence. In everything we do, we remain true to our roots: as a regionally connected family business that always stays firmly grounded in spite of our stellar high-tech. Here’s to your unique future with us: Yours!
 Obiectivul Principal
 Verificarea produselor HARTING din punct de vedere a functionalitatii si fiabilitatii.
 Responsabilitati
 Indeplinirea activitatiilor specifice de masurare /testare unui tehnician de laborator:
Documentarea rezultatelor masuratorilor/testelor corespunzator sistemului de calitate Harting;
Colaborarea stransa cu solicitantii comenzilor de masurare/testare si departamentul dezvoltare;
Consiliere si sprijin pentru departamentele companiei in rezolvarea problemelor de masurare/testare;
Verificarea masuratorilor /testarilor efectuate in locatii externe;
Responsabilitatea pentru intocmirea profesionala a masuratorilor/testarilor si pentru corectitudinea rapoartelor de masurare;
 Arhivarea si controlul documentelor;
Implicare in mentinerea si dezvoltarea aplicarii standardului ISO/IEC 17025;
 Cerinte
 Pregatire profesionala: studii superioare;
Experienta: minim 1-3 ani in activitati similare;
Acuitate vizuala;
Acuratete in special in lucrul cu cifrele;
Cunostinte de desen tehnic;
Operare MS Office;
Cunoasterea si utilizarea la nivel avansat a cel putin unei limbi straine de circulatie: engleza/ germana (germana reprezinta un avantaj);
Benefits: Flexibility (RO), Meal tickets (RO), Medical services (RO), Annual bonus salary (RO), Recreational activities (RO)
